<title>CANADA: August WCE canola up sharply as UGG buys.</title>
<headline>August WCE canola up sharply as UGG buys.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>August Winnipeg Commodity Exchange canola futures rose C$9.20 a tonne as United Grain Growers Ltd bought and RBC-DS bought August-November spreads, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;There's not much for sale. UGG's buying the August and RBC-DS is buying the Aug-Nov spread,&quot; a trader said.</p>
<p>WCE oilseed daily trading limits are C$10 a tonne.</p>
<p>At 1020 CDT, August WCE canola futures were up C$9.20 at C$363.50.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
